nfraction of its `n + m` vertices and of its `n` customers, the forest flag\n`γ = 0`, and the (2, 2)-core of `B` (`learning.cover_excess.peel`) as a\nfraction of the customers, the patterns and the vertices; and joins the\ncertified optimum where there is one. Three sources, 64,291 rows:\n\n| source | rows | size range | how the matrix was obtained |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| \n----\ninstance_name,cell,generator,n,m,param,index,seed,solve_seconds,optimum,solve_nodes,solve_proof,certified,witness_ok,status_default,nodes_default,seconds_default,status_csearch,nodes_csearch,seconds_csearch,n_customers,n_patterns,n_ones,density,shape_ratio,distinct_col_frac,distinct_row_frac,dominated_col_frac,row_min,row_max,row_mean,row_std,col_min,col_max,col_mean,col_std,col_max_frac,g_nodes,g_edges,g_density,g_components,g_largest_comp_frac,g_clustering,g_degeneracy,g_deg_min,g_deg_max,g_deg_mean,g_deg_std,lb_trivial,lb_contraction,lb_best,ub_mcn,ub_cs_dfs,ub_best,bound_gap,bound_gap_frac,tw_min_fill,tw_min_degree,bw_rcm,spectral_radius,fiedler,fiedler_lcc,cc_products,cc_greedy,sep_size,sep_frac,rig_edge_prob,rig_deg_expected,rig_density_ratio,feature_seconds,matrix_digest,graph_cert,bipartite_cert,wl_hash,aut_order,complete_graph,total_seconds\nens_f_n10_m10_d2_i008,f_n10_m10_d2,fixed,10,10,2,8,50465599,0.004,4,0,bound,True,True,unsat,10,0.0005,unsat,5,0.0001,10,10,22,0.22,1,0.7,0.9,0.3,1,5,2.2,1.32665,2,4,2.2,0.6,0.4,10,12,0.266667,1,1,0.28,3,1,5,2.4,1.28062,4,4,4,4,4,4,0,0,3,3,4,3.2729,0.301027,0.301027,7,7,1,0.1,0.391102,3.51992,0.681834,0.0046,19dd024995ec81e9007e6e90,f6f0e87da14f66b29b9a589f,59fb2705a27b051bc1bc5800,0cd048772217fa0e3d7eccf60baedcfe,4,False,0.0099\ninstance_name,cell,generator,n,m,param,index,seed,solve_seconds,optimum,solve_nodes,solve_proof,certified,witness_ok,status_default,nodes_default,seconds_default,status_csearch,nodes_csearch,seconds_csearch,n_customers,n_patterns,n_ones,density,shape_ratio,distinct_col_frac,distinct_row_frac,dominated_col_frac,row_min,r